{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.96, "text": "And I am tired of hearing these comments."}, {"start": 2.74, "end": 5.38, "text": "Oh, we bought a house when it was 17% interest."}, {"start": 5.94, "end": 8.52, "text": "Yeah, the houses were a fraction of what they cost today."}, {"start": 8.92, "end": 11.3, "text": "And if you look at what they were as a percentage of income,"}, {"start": 11.66, "end": 13.26, "text": "they were way lower, it was achievable."}, {"start": 13.76, "end": 15.18, "text": "We know this because there were a lot of people"}, {"start": 15.18, "end": 18.42, "text": "who bought a very nice house on one income"}, {"start": 18.42, "end": 22.18, "text": "that is effectively impossible today, thanks to NIMBYism."}, {"start": 22.72, "end": 24.68, "text": "So actually just asking your children,"}, {"start": 24.76, "end": 26.7, "text": "hey, I know it's really tough right now."}, {"start": 26.88, "end": 28.48, "text": "Can you just, like, what's it like?"}, {"start": 28.96, "end": 32.48, "text": "How much are you spending on food and housing?"}, {"start": 32.96, "end": 33.94, "text": "And how does that break down?"}, {"start": 34.2, "end": 35.94, "text": "And oh my gosh, here's what we spent."}, {"start": 36.64, "end": 38.08, "text": "Wow, if I had to do that today,"}, {"start": 38.22, "end": 39.68, "text": "I don't know how I would do it."}, {"start": 40.0, "end": 43.5, "text": "There is power in just acknowledging and validating."}, {"start": 43.74, "end": 45.1, "text": "And there are so many young people"}, {"start": 45.1, "end": 47.84, "text": "who would love to hear their parents just say,"}, {"start": 48.26, "end": 50.66, "text": "wow, that's gotta be really tough, I had no idea."}], "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.08}, {"w": "I", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.28}, {"w": "am", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.38}, {"w": "tired", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.66}, {"w": "of", "start": 0.66, "end": 0.82}, {"w": "hearing", "start": 0.82, "end": 0.98},